   "stem_html": "<figure id=\"fig7_65\">\n<img src=\"exercises/media/33d05e18a91a445b.png\" alt=\"Map of the United States depicting the region from the eastern seaboard and continuing west to the middle of the country.\">\n<figcaption>A map of the westward expansion of the United States.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<p><i>Refer to the map provided.</i></p>\n<p>The map best illustrates the United States’ continental expansion in the aftermath of</p>",
